WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,430
Can these people still go?

2
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:04,290
You can't survive if you go in.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,240
Did you guys have a problem with this game?

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,960
It’s my private business created by the gods.

5
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:12,160
I am willing to open the divine protection field to everyone

6
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:14,190
Channel maintenance time is limited

7
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:16,310
Entering into human training above Shangcao

8
00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:19,410
Just let them settle it and I quit

9
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:21,770
My status is currently inaccessible

10
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:23,490
Otherwise it will only take off the hind legs

11
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:32,860
You continue your treasure hunt

12
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,140
I'm here

13
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:42,140
Don’t underestimate Tianjiao who is above the sky

14
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:45,580
The previous blood-born son was not the strongest Lao Deng

15
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:48,460
You'd better worry about Tianjiao, who is above heaven.

16
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,900
Can they withstand a slap?

17
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:55,370
What he said makes sense

18
00:00:55,690 --> 00:00:58,070
As long as he doesn't break out of the building

19
00:00:59,610 --> 00:01:00,810
Channel is about to close

20
00:01:01,090 --> 00:01:02,010
Enter now

21
00:01:02,330 --> 00:01:03,730
Everyone, let's go

22
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:05,730
Let the little cubs above heaven

23
00:01:05,850 --> 00:01:07,530
Let’s be realistic about how powerful we are

24
00:01:08,970 --> 00:01:15,870
Hard to come back
